                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The ground rules {{uitgangspuntenReferentie}} for the execution phase of project {{projectNumber}} — {{projectName}} were agreed on {{uitgangspuntenVastgesteldOp}} with {{uitgangspuntenDeelnemers}}."
